# FieldLayer.bwe

[Layer]
name: FieldLayer
role: Represent and update the organism field x(r, t).

[State]
type: grid
dimensions: configurable
components: density, activity, stress (extensible)

[UpdateRule]
equation: dx/dt = E_s[x]
supports:
  - diffusion-like terms
  - growth/decay
  - branching/retreat
  - local perturbations